  name: 'Cyrus Jalen Cornejo',
  role: 'Tech VA-Business Automation Specialist',
  tagline: 'Process-minded automation for businesses that run on follow-ups',
  location: 'Candelaria, Quezon',
  email: 'cyrus.cornejo09@gmail.com',
  about: [
    "I'm CY, an automation specialist based in the Philippines. Before this, I spent 7+ years in administrative and HR operations for a government education office",
    "which means I didn't come into automation from a tech background. I came into it from watching how much time gets lost to manual follow-ups, missed messages, and processes that live in someone's head instead of a system.",
    "Now I build that system for you  using tools like ManyChat, Zapier, n8n, GHL and  so your business runs the same whether you're on--site, asleep, or on holiday.",
  ],
  stats: [
    { value: '7+', label: 'Administrative and HR operations' },
    { value: '9', label: 'Automations Projects' },
    
