The result: Every lead gets the right next action, at the right time, without you tracking it manually.`,
  tags: [, 'Automation', 'Zapier'],
  image: '/AsanaLeadEnrichment.png',
  href: '#',
  year: '2026',
},
 {
  title: 'Automated Lead Enrichment & Notification System (Zapier)',
  description: `The problem: New leads coming in through a form or tool, sitting unnoticed until someone happens to check their inbox.
What I built: A webhook-driven system that catches new leads instantly, enriches the data, and splits them by condition — logging qualified leads to a sheet with a live Slack alert, or triggering a targeted follow-up email.
The result: Your team knows about a new lead within seconds, not hours.`,
  tags: [, 'Automation', 'Zapier'],
  image: '/AutomatedLeadsEnrichment.png',
  href: '#',
  year: '2026',
},
 {
  title: 'Client Onboarding Automation (Make.com)',
  description: `The problem: Onboarding checklists that live in someone's head — a welcome email forgotten, a client folder never created, no one told to prep for the kickoff call.
What I built: A system that fires the moment a new client is added: sends the welcome email, creates their folder, books the kickoff on your calendar, and pings your team in Slack — automatically.
The result: Every client gets the same smooth start, and nothing falls through the cracks.`,
  tags: [, 'Automation', 'Make.com'],
  image: '/ClientOnBoarding.png',
  href: '#',
  year: '2026',
},
   {
  title: 'AI Website Chat Agent with Knowledge Base & CRM Lead Capture (n8n)',
  description: `The problem: Website visitors asking the same questions at all hours, with no one available to answer — and interested leads slipping away because no one captured their info.
What I built: An AI chat agent embedded on the website that answers from a custom knowledge base (via Qdrant vector search), with a fallback model if the primary AI errors out, and automatically saves qualified leads straight to the CRM mid-conversation.
The result: Visitors get instant, accurate answers 24/7, and every qualified conversation becomes a captured lead — no manual chat monitoring required..`,
  tags: [, 'Automation', 'n8n','RAG / VectorSearch(Qdrant)','CRM Integration'],
  image: '/AI_Website_Chat Agent_with Knowledge Base_CRM_Lead Capture.png',
  href: '#',
  year: '2026',
},
   {
