What I built: An ingestion workflow that takes raw documents, chunks them, generates embeddings, and inserts them into a Qdrant vector database with one manual trigger.
The result: Updating the AI agent’s knowledge is now a one-click process instead of a manual rebuild.`,
  tags: [, 'Automation', 'n8n','RAG/VectorSearch(Qdrant)','Text Embeddings','Data Ingestion'],
  image: '/Knowledge Base Ingestion Pipeline (n8n).png',
  href: '#',
