The result: Reps spend their time only on leads worth chasing, with every lead automatically triaged instead of manually reviewed..`,
  tags: [, 'n8n', 'AI Lead Scoring', 'Lead Qualification', 'Conditional Routing', 'Prompt Engineering',],
