  description: `The problem: Leads sitting in different pipeline stages with no consistent next step — some get forgotten, some get a folder, some never get a follow-up email.
What I built: A system that watches every task update in Asana and routes the lead by stage — creating folders, spinning up content tasks, and sending the right follow-up email automatically, with built-in delays so nothing feels robotic.
The result: Every lead gets the right next action, at the right time, without you tracking it manually.`,
  tags: [, 'n8n', 'AI Agent Development', 'FAQ Automation', 'Prompt Injection Defense', 'Human Handoff Workflows', ],
